[Controls]
Joystick in port 2.

[Keys - menu only]
i - information
s - sound effects only, or effects + music
Esc - quit the game

[Needs]
Any Amiga with 1 MB of memory, Kickstart 1.3 or later.

[Credits]
Original game by Locomalito and Gryzor87. Amiga port by jeegfro, music by Simone "JMD" Bernacchia.
